## 🔐 Permissions Matrix Summary

| Layer | Who Can Access |
| --- | --- |
| `/data/bmo/` | Everyone |
| `/data/domains/*` | Users in the matching domain |
| `/data/.../subdomains/*` | Only users in that subdomain |
| `/data/external/` | Everyone |
| `/data/user_data/` | Only the respective user |
| `/prompts/global/` | Everyone |
| `/prompts/domains/` | Domain members and above |
| `/prompts/subdomains/` | Subdomain members and above |
| `/prompts/user_specific/` | Only that user |
| `/conversations/` | Only the user themselves (or admin for audits) |

